# GitHub repositories whose latest release is installed in the Retrobox image,
# in install order. They are the components retroboxproject.github.io installs
# on a desktop; the packages are not in Debian, so they come from their releases.
RetroboxProject/retrobox-core
RetroboxProject/retrobox-mangohud
RetroboxProject/retrobox-emulationstation
RetroboxProject/retrobox-overlay
